~
0 0 bdvL cnG 3
2 0 0 15 -1 -1
D
   Her woven tunic is patterned with subtle geometric designs, reinforced at
the shoulders with leather straps darkened by long years of use. Her skin has a
warm bronze tone and her long hair is braided tightly to keep it clear of her
work. Fine cords and small tools hang at her belt, and her hands are steady as
she works dark metal into narrow, glowing bands.
~
