saoirse gleaming~
Saoirse~
Saoirse the Gleaming is working the anvil. (list)
~
0 0 bdvL cnG 3
2 0 0 15 -1 -1
D
   She's dressed in layered linen and wool, muted in color and tied back for
work, with a heavy apron protecting her from stray sparks of light. Pale
freckles dust her fair skin, and her red hair is gathered into a loose twist at
the back of her head. A simple knotwork charm is stitched into her sleeve,
nearly hidden. She turns pieces in her hands thoughtfully, as if weighing more
than just the material.
~
