percy unfaltering~
Percy~
Percy the Unfaltering is examining something closely. (list)
~
0 0 bdvL cnG 3
1 0 0 15 -1 -1
D
   He wears a well-worn smith's apron over plain, practical clothing. The
sleeves and edges show signs they have been neatly mended many times over. His
arms are marked by old burns, but he keeps his sleeves rolled up as he works.
His brown hair is beginning to gray at the temples. He squints slightly as he
inspects his creations, tinkering with them patiently until they're just so.
~
