Somsak~
Somsak the Ordered is organizing items into the bins. (list)
~
0 0 bdvL cnG 3
1 0 0 15 -1 -1
D
   He wears loose, lightweight garments suited for long hours of work, belted
securely to keep them clear as he glides back and forth, every movement
perfectly silent as he stacks, counts, and arranges everything. His dark hair
is cropped short his face is calm but concerted as he gives you a small nod
before returning to his tasks.
~
